e to use the `attest-build-provenance` action, but new implementations should use `actions/attest` instead.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Bump actions/attest from 4.2.0 to 4.2.1 in the actions-minor group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/actions/attest-build-provenance/pull/862\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/actions/attest-build-provenance/compare/v4.1.1...v4.2.2","mentions_count":1}